          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are all products sold on NEXORA 100% genuine and original?",
            "answer": "Yes, unconditionally. NEXORA is an officially contracted distributor and authorized tier-1 retailer for all featured brands. Every package includes verified manufacturer serial tags and authentic warranty documentation that can be registered online."
